{"id":"franchement","lemma":"franchement","pos":"adv","rank":1215,"glosses":["frankly; sincerely","vigorously, without doubting oneself","really, downright, outright"],"ipa":"/fʁɑ̃ʃ.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e1/Fr-franchement.ogg/Fr-franchement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je veux que tu parles franchement.","en":"I want you to speak frankly.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"that / what"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"you must be joking!"]]},{"text":"Dis-le-moi franchement.","en":"Tell me frankly.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"me"},null]},{"text":"Franchement, je ne pense pas.","en":"Frankly, I don't think so.","words":[null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,5,"I don't think so"]]},{"text":"Franchement, je trouve ça difficile à croire.","en":"Frankly, I find that hard to believe.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to find","l":"trouver"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"difficult"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to believe"}]},{"text":"Pour parler franchement, il a tort.","en":"Frankly speaking, he's wrong.","words":[{"g":"for"},{"g":"to speak, talk"},null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"fault"}]}]}